{"ticker":"ARDEE","symbol":"ARDEE","instrumentId":3203702,"name":"Ardee Industries Ltd","industry":"NSE-Metal Proc & Fabrication","about":"\"Ardee Industries operates in the secondary metals industry, recycling lead-bearing scrap into refined lead and value-added lead alloys. Its single manufacturing facility has installed recycling capacity of 156,950 MT annually and serves domestic and international markets.\n\nIts products include refined lead with 99.97%-99.985% purity and lead alloys containing calcium, antimony, tin and cadmium. The company sources materials such as used lead-acid batteries, lead scrap, remelted lead and cable scrap for recycling.\n\nProducts are used in batteries, cables, construction, electrical equipment, ammunition, radiation shielding and other industrial applications. Operations include scrap processing, smelting, refining, alloy manufacturing, quality testing and delivery.\"","website":"www.ardeeindustries.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:03:39.114Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":39.68,"changePct":-4.477611940298506,"week52High":67.33,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,251 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,018 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"100,864,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"25"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"18,615,268"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"6.87"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"10.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.7"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.42"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-82%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"30.29"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"—"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"57.5%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"1.17"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,029,459"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,379,943"},{"label":"Master score","value":"10"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"83"},{"label":"Price str